# Claude auth — pick ONE of the two blocks below.

# (a) Subscription. Get a token with `claude setup-token`.
#     Add the ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL line only if you want LLM traffic to go through
#     the gateway (observability); leave it out to go direct to Anthropic.
#     ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN is not forwarded in this mode; only `-e ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=...`
#     would reach the box, and it would shadow the OAuth token.
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=http://host.boxlite.internal:15002/claude

# (b) API key. Setting ANY ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL — this gateway or an unrelated
#     proxy you already use — tells the box the credential lives outside it:
#     ANTHROPIC_API_KEY then stops being forwarded and stays on the host.
#     cbox gives the box a placeholder ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN itself (any value
#     set here is replaced); a different proxy that needs a real token gets it
#     via `-e ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=...`. Only omit ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL entirely
#     if you want the key sent into the box directly.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=http://host.boxlite.internal:15002/api

# Optional — only needed if ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is not an Anthropic key (e.g. a
# LiteLLM key). Format is host:port — no scheme (not https://...) and no
# path (not /v1) — e.g. litellm.example.net:443, not
# https://litellm.example.net/v1. The port is required; a bare hostname with
# no port crash-loops the gateway. Defaults to api.anthropic.com:443 when
# unset. This is the gateway's *outbound* target for the /api route — always
# reached over TLS regardless of which host is set here — distinct from
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL above, which is where the box sends traffic (the
# gateway itself). Setting this to the gateway's own address would not make
# sense and is not what it's for.
# AGENTGATEWAY_ANTHROPIC_UPSTREAM_HOST=litellm.example.net:443

# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=         # optional

# GitHub (optional) — enables gh + git push/pull over HTTPS
# GH_TOKEN=

# Plugin marketplaces/plugins (optional), baked in by `just build-image`.
# Comma-separated. Each one set REPLACES the default of the same name in
# custom/Dockerfile (it doesn't append), so copy the defaults in to keep any.
# CBOX_MARKETPLACES=anthropics/claude-plugins-official,the-mentor/no-ai-attribution
# CBOX_PLUGINS=no-ai-attribution@no-ai-attribution,rust-analyzer-lsp@claude-plugins-official

# Private plugin marketplaces (optional), baked in by `just build-image`.
# Comma-separated, same format as CBOX_MARKETPLACES/CBOX_PLUGINS above.
# Needs a token that can read these repos: GH_TOKEN above, else `gh auth token`.
# A fine-grained PAT with Contents: read on just these repos is the tightest.
# CBOX_PRIVATE_MARKETPLACES=owner/repo
# CBOX_PRIVATE_PLUGINS=plugin@marketplace

# Git identity (optional)
# GIT_AUTHOR_NAME=
# GIT_AUTHOR_EMAIL=
